{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44815","headline":"宿严维宅简章八元 · 清江","name":"宿严维宅简章八元","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佳期曾不远，甲第即南邻。\n惠爱偏相及，经过岂厌频。\n秋寒林叶动，夕霁月华新。\n莫话羁栖事，平原是主人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清江","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}